		(property "Notes" "Igniter series current limit, 2 x 1R in series per channel (3R total with the 1R e-match: ~0.86A at 3.0V, ~1.27A at 4.2V; MJG BP starter all-fire 0.60A, recommended 0.75-1.0A). Per resistor: 1.6W while the match is intact (ms), 3.4W into a shorted output (4.2V/2.3R = 1.83A). Bourns CRM2512 pulse curve (>=1R): ~6W for a 1s single pulse, ~27W for 0.1s. Limit firmware fire time to <= 1s."
			(at 101.6 83.82 0)
			(hide yes)
